# User data (should never be checked in). Anchored to repo root so they
# don't accidentally swallow source folders like
# `apps/Rubick/Sources/Models/` or `apps/.../data/`.
# (`~/Library/Application Support/Rubick/` is the runtime data dir and
# isn't inside the repo anyway, but we keep the pattern around as a
# breadcrumb for future contributors.)
/data/
/models/
/thumbnails/

